            "handlerDescription": "List the verified client's OPEN invoices (their receivables), oldest first, at most 25: invoice_no, buyer, invoice date, due date, currency, amount, open amount, payment terms (for example 2/10 NET 30) and the early-pay date. Pass an empty search for all open invoices, or a buyer name, an invoice number or an amount. Returns NO_MATCH when nothing matches. These are the candidates for applying an incoming payment.",
