      "id": "flow:confirm_trace_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "confirm_trace_flow",
        "description": "Step 2 of 2: open the trace the client has explicitly confirmed. Pass the action_id from propose_trace. The system re-checks every rule; proposals expire after 15 minutes. Returns OPENED with the investigation_id (INV-2026-NNNN) and the estimated response date, or NOT_EXECUTED with reason_code NO_SUCH_PROPOSAL, EXPIRED, ALREADY_EXECUTED, SESSION_INVALID or a rule&#39;s code. Only call after the client says yes to the exact proposal; never call it without a fresh action_id.",
