    {
      "id": "flow:open_review_case_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "open_review_case_flow",
        "description": "Hand a request that a person must own to the right team: PAYMENT_REPAIR (fix beneficiary details and re-send), FEE_WAIVER (waive or refund a fee on a payment; reference_id = that payment_ref), COMPENSATION, FRAUD (suspected fraud), SANCTIONS_QUERY (a payment held for sanctions screening) or OTHER. A recall is not opened here - use propose_recall. The system routes it, works out what a person could approve (for a fee waiver: refund that fee) and returns CASE_OPENED with case_id (CASE-NNNNN), the assigned team, reply time and requested amount, ALREADY_OPEN when the same request is already with the team, or NOT_OPENED with BAD_TYPE, BAD_REFERENCE or SESSION_INVALID. Supply a neutral brief: facts only, no recommendation. A person decides; the assistant never decides, approves, promises or predicts the outcome.",
        "links": [
          {
            "id": 1,
            "from": "StartActivity",
            "to": "GuardedWrite",
            "type": "label",
            "label": "StartActivity to GuardedWrite"
