    {
      "id": "flow:get_open_invoices_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "get_open_invoices_flow",
        "description": "List the verified client&#39;s OPEN invoices (their receivables), oldest first, at most 25: invoice_no, buyer, invoice date, due date, currency, amount, open amount, payment terms (for example 2/10 NET 30) and the early-pay date. Pass an empty search for all open invoices, or a buyer name, an invoice number or an amount. Returns NO_MATCH when nothing matches. These are the candidates for applying an incoming payment.",
