    {
      "id": "flow:confirm_cash_application_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "confirm_cash_application_flow",
        "description": "Step 2 of 2: post the cash application the client has explicitly confirmed. Pass the application_id from propose_cash_application. The system re-checks the payment and the invoices; proposals expire after 15 minutes. Returns APPLIED with the invoice status and, when a disputed deduction is over the small-balance tolerance, the review case_id, team and reply date (a person at Client Servicing decides the deduction); or NOT_APPLIED with reason_code NO_SUCH_APPLICATION, EXPIRED, ALREADY_APPLIED, INVOICES_CHANGED or SESSION_INVALID. Only call after the client says yes to the exact proposal.",
        "links": [
